        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Authentic gongura mutton uses "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gongura",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "gongura"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " leaves for sharp sourness. Here, spinach and tamarind together approximate that flavour. The key step is to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "bhuno",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "bhuno"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " the lamb well so the oil separates before adding the greens."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use bone-in lamb shoulder pieces if you can. The bones add body and depth to the sauce over the long cook."
          }
        ]
